  "body": "Enjoy a fresh start in this brand-new freehold home, thoughtfully arranged for comfortable family living. With four bedrooms, inviting outdoor spaces and a low-maintenance setting, it brings together the features that make everyday life easier.\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area forms the heart of the home, offering a bright and welcoming space to gather. Whether you are preparing dinner, sharing a relaxed weekend breakfast or spending time with friends, the connected layout keeps everyone together. The modern designer kitchen combines quality finishes with ample storage, providing a practical space for cooking and entertaining.\r\nFrom the living area, step outside onto the deck and into the fully fenced, landscaped garden. This outdoor setting extends your living space, with room to enjoy a morning coffee, dine outdoors or unwind at the end of the day. Easy-care landscaping allows you to spend more time enjoying your home and less time maintaining it.\r\nAll four bedrooms are positioned upstairs, creating a dedicated retreat away from the main living area. The master bedroom features its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while the remaining bedrooms offer flexibility for family, guests or a home office.\r\nAn internal-access single garage adds convenience, and the low-maintenance design suits both busy households and buyers looking for a lock-and-leave lifestyle. The surrounding neighbourhood puts shopping, dining and recreation within easy reach. Explore Milford Village and its mall, meet friends at local cafes, or enjoy nearby beaches and parks. Public transport, North Shore Hospital and other everyday amenities are also conveniently close.\r\nZoned for Forrest Hill Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School, this home offers an appealing combination of modern living and access to established schools.\r\nContact Ming on 021 024 63600 to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Photos are for marketing purposes only and are from the show home at 37F Corunna Road. They may not accurately represent the property being advertised.",
